# Artefacts téléchargés : rapports (PDF), pages rendues (PNG), fichiers de données.
# 22 Mo après un seul appel à latest_figures() sur 3 pays : rien de tout ça ne se
# versionne. Le repo publie du CODE, la donnée se re-télécharge.
_report_cache/
*.pdf
*.png
*.xlsx
*.xls

.vscode/
.idea/
# config.py is published (no secrets — only public endpoints and free app IDs)
# Keep credentials in keyring or .env (which IS gitignored)

# Working notes that must never reach a public remote: they describe the local
# environment (credential inventory, network diagnostics, machine paths) rather
# than the toolkit. Keep them local; publish conclusions in references/ instead.
health_check*.md
*_ACCESS.md
*_FINDINGS.md
NOTES_*.md
C_tmp/
